        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced and dynamic blackjack experience, set against dark-themed tables and adorned with epic hero battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of a tie, fate is decided by a coin toss. Each round offers unique combinations, and with just three intense turns, every match becomes a thrilling clash of wits and luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/dc3a65dbb45289d472540f9f1e37163a.avif?t=1761140666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/dc3a65dbb45289d472540f9f1e37163a.avif?t=1761140666 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the power in every strike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With distinct classes, custom effects, and immersive sound design, every move places you right in the heart of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character reflects a unique playstyle, and the rhythm of combat shifts accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/fe3cb05aa096d011ad42dc04695e4e1d.avif?t=1761140666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/fe3cb05aa096d011ad42dc04695e4e1d.avif?t=1761140666 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique atmosphere shaped by dark-themed tables that evolve as you level up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the ambiance transforms, and each level introduces a new table with its own dark and immersive theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage opens the door to a deeper, more mysterious, and more captivating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/b497698dc0239a02ac716406a7424723.avif?t=1761140666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/b497698dc0239a02ac716406a7424723.avif?t=1761140666 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the course of battle with powerful abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 13 abilities, the right moves can swing the table’s advantage in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you must demonstrate the resolve to pick the ability according to the revealed cards.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced and dynamic blackjack experience, set against dark-themed tables and adorned with epic hero battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of a tie, fate is decided by a coin toss. Each round offers unique combinations, and with just three intense turns, every match becomes a thrilling clash of wits and luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/dc3a65dbb45289d472540f9f1e37163a.avif?t=1761140666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/dc3a65dbb45289d472540f9f1e37163a.avif?t=1761140666 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the power in every strike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With distinct classes, custom effects, and immersive sound design, every move places you right in the heart of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character reflects a unique playstyle, and the rhythm of combat shifts accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/fe3cb05aa096d011ad42dc04695e4e1d.avif?t=1761140666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/fe3cb05aa096d011ad42dc04695e4e1d.avif?t=1761140666 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique atmosphere shaped by dark-themed tables that evolve as you level up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the ambiance transforms, and each level introduces a new table with its own dark and immersive theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage opens the door to a deeper, more mysterious, and more captivating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/b497698dc0239a02ac716406a7424723.avif?t=1761140666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/b497698dc0239a02ac716406a7424723.avif?t=1761140666 width=1560 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the course of battle with powerful abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 13 abilities, the right moves can swing the table’s advantage in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, you must demonstrate the resolve to pick the ability according to the revealed cards.</p>",
